{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Header_Banner.png?t=1746168503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a psychological horror adventure happening inside the mind of Felipe, a young boy with a unique perspective of the world.\u00a0Trapped in a space station on the brink of collapse, Felipe is forced to face the unknown, and his deepest fears as he explores his surroundings and fights for his freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Felipe is diagnosed with Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD). Through Midnight Dreams, the game aims to promote empathy amongst players, and provide a broader, more immersive understanding on the topic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Escape.png?t=1746168503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Escape.gif?t=1746168503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Fears.png?t=1746168503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Fears.gif?t=1746168503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Explore.png?t=1746168503\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439310/extras/Explore.gif?t=1746168503\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2439310?t=1746168503","background_raw":"https://shared.aka